{"ref":"BDB, חָמֵץ²","hw":"חָמֵץ²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָמֵץ</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:3\" href=\"/Exodus.13.3\">Ex 13:3</a></sup> <strong>that which is leavened</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:15\" href=\"/Exodus.12.15\">Ex 12:15</a> + 10 times—forbidden at Passover <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:15\" href=\"/Exodus.12.15\">Ex 12:15</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:3\" href=\"/Exodus.13.3\">13:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:7\" href=\"/Exodus.13.7\">7</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.3\">Dt 16:3</a>, in all sacrifices <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:18\" href=\"/Exodus.23.18\">Ex 23:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:25\" href=\"/Exodus.34.25\">34:25</a> (both JE); cf. <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:5\" href=\"/Amos.4.5\">Am 4:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:11\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.11\">Lv 2:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.10\">6:10</a> (P; appos.); exceptions are <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם ח׳</span> of peace-offering <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.13\">Lv 7:13</a> (P), and the wave-loaves (<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> appos.) <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.17\">Lv 23:17</a> (H).—v. RS<sup>Sem 203 OTJC 2, 345</sup>.","next":"BDB, חֹ֫מֶץ","prev":"BDB, חָמֵץ"}